  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call upon your dragonmark's power to aid your reflex and skill. When you Cast the Spell, any acrobatics actions with the Move trait, Piloting checks, or Sailing checks on a sea or air vehicles gain a +1 status bonus. This bonus remains as long as you Sustain the Spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You do not need to sustain Windwright's Intuition.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The bonus increases to +2.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The bonus increases to +3.</p>"
    },
